<p>Anyone who watches or follows League of Legends E-sports can agree on one thing: T1 is notorious for having a horrible domestic performance.</p>
<p>The team’s win rate is consistently negative, and it always looks like they won’t make it far through the finals bracket…but somehow they always do. In fact, they can’t seem to stop winning the whole competition. How is that?</p>
