<p>In 2024 you have almost a 25% increase in win rate, and almost a 20% increase in 2025. That’s far from an insignificant amount. Despite what a lot of people say, it isn’t luck (or magic) that gives them the sudden change in outcome. During Finals, T1 puts a heavier focus on game objectives, like dragons or towers, which when secured, boosts their chance for a win substantially.</p>
<p>But why do securing these objectives make such a difference? It all comes down to money, or gold. While not a guarantee, it’s pretty clear that the team with the gold advantage has a better shot at winning.</p>
