<p>Gold is an often overlooked factor in games, with the focus falling to kills or team-fights. While those are still important to the game’s outcome, a single team-fight won’t secure you the win.</p>
<p>It all comes down to T1 getting better items faster, which completely depends on securing those objectives, or gold, faster than their opponent.</p>
